[[File:Shop Champs.jpg|thumb|300px|The main menu of the shop in {{g|Champions}}]]
The '''Shop''' (Japanese: '''ショップ''' ''Shop'') screen in {{g|Champions}} is divided into two sections: the '''Premium Shop''' (Japanese: '''プレミアムショップ''' ''Premium Shop''), where memberships and Premium Battle Passes can be purchased with real-world currency, and the '''[[Frontier]] Shop''' (Japanese: '''フロンティアショップ''' ''Frontier Shop''), where [[Victory Point|VP]] can be exchanged for [[held item]]s and clothing.

==Premium Shop==
Where prices differ between the Nintendo eShop and the App Store, the price on the Nintendo eShop is listed first and the price on the App Store is listed second.

